   "D cells are doorways 196 units tall without zone portals; pass doorMesh for door movers.",
   "Spaces that touch are joined by full-width openings without zone portals (autoDoorways false leaves them out).",
   "Cameras and lasers all report to one alarm, Alarm1.",
   "The plan places its own lights, so rooms get no automatic ceiling lights (defaults.lights \"none\")."
